       92  ==Economy==
       93  The district has a total of 6,500 registered companies; however, agriculture is the most important sector. Agricultural land comprises {{convert|56363|ha|sqmi}} (74.7 percent) of the total land area. Arable land comprises {{convert|42300|ha|sqmi}} (56.1 percent) of total agricultural land, which inc
       94  ==Education==
       95  The district operates 32 [[kindergartens]], two primary schools, 10 secondary schools, eight general-education schools and eight higher-education institutes serving a student population of 9,158. Vocational training is available in [[Glodeni]] and [[Ciuciulea]].
       96  ==Politics==
