      185  ==Culture==
      186  [[File:Costache Leancă (1893-1942).jpg|thumb|Costache Leancă|alt=Photo of early 20th-century politician Costache Leancă]]
      187  The district has a children's center, schools of art, music and fine arts, 27 cultural houses, 35 public libraries, five museums, 97 works of art and 17 musical groups.
      188  ==Health==
      189  Glodeni has a 200-bed hospital, 13 family practitioners, 10 health centers, 4 health offices and 26 [[pharmacies]].
